---
// Page body converted from the Claude Design handoff (home-r3.html). Edit freely.
import { site, u } from '../../data/site';
import FormMeta from '../FormMeta.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import kevinDesk from '../../assets/kevin-loo-desk.jpg';
---
<div class="hero on-dark">
<div class="hero-in">
<div class="hero-split">
<div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>For small and growing businesses</p>
<h1 class="h1 hero-h">Hand the books to someone who <span class="em">picks up the phone</span>.</h1>
<p class="lead hero-lead">Bookkeeping, payroll and CFO work for small and growing businesses across British Columbia. Based in Victoria, working province-wide.</p>
<div class="hero-act">
<a class="tel-lg" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>
<a class="btn btn-1" href={u('/contact/')}>Book a call</a>
</div>
<p class="small muted ph">{site.hours}</p>
</div>
<form class="hero-form" data-form method="post" action={site.formEndpoint}>
<FormMeta source="Home page" />
<h2 class="h4 card-h">Tell us what is on your plate.</h2>
<div class="form-row">
<label class="field field-s"><span class="field-lab">Name</span><input class="field-in" name="name" required type="text"></label>
<label class="field field-s"><span class="field-lab">Phone</span><input class="field-in" name="phone" type="tel"></label>
</div>
<label class="field field-w"><span class="field-lab">Email</span><input class="field-in" name="email" required type="email"></label>
<label class="field field-w"><span class="field-lab">What needs taking off your plate</span><textarea class="field-in field-ta" name="message" required></textarea></label>
<button class="btn btn-1" type="submit">Send it over</button>
<p class="form-note" data-form-note>Rather talk? The number above reaches the same place.</p>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="seam">
<section class="seg seg-tan">
<div class="seg-in c-center">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Trusted with the books</p>
<ul class="home-facts">
<li class="fact"><span class="fact-k">Who runs it</span><span class="fact-v">Kevin Loo, CPA, CMA. He works on every file himself.</span></li>
<li class="fact"><span class="fact-k">Who it is for</span><span class="fact-v">Small and growing businesses that want an accountant they can actually reach.</span></li>
<li class="fact"><span class="fact-k">Where</span><span class="fact-v">Based in Victoria, working with businesses across British Columbia.</span></li>
</ul>

<div style="margin-top:var(--pad-major)">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>How we can help</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-5)">Six things off your plate, starting with the one costing you evenings.</h2>
<p class="p" style="margin-bottom:0">Take one, or take all six.</p>
<div class="grid help-grid">
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">01</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Bookkeeping</h3>
<p class="card-p">Transactions recorded, accounts reconciled, and a close that lands the same way every month. You send the paperwork over. That is your part.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#bookkeeping')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">02</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Accounts payable</h3>
<p class="card-p">Payments out, on the schedule you set, without you approving each one twice.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#accounts-payable')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">03</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Accounts receivable</h3>
<p class="card-p">Invoices followed up on a schedule, so you are not the one making that call after a long day.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#accounts-receivable')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">04</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Payroll</h3>
<p class="card-p">Your team paid on time, remittances sent before anyone chases them, and every pay run recorded properly.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#payroll')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">05</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Controllership</h3>
<p class="card-p">A senior review of the books, so the close is checked and the statements are bank-ready.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#controllership')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<p class="eyebrow card-k">06</p>
<h3 class="h3 card-h">Fractional CFO</h3>
<p class="card-p">CFO-level thinking on when to grow, when to hire, and when to hold off.</p>
<a class="btn-txt card-more" href={u('/services/#fractional-cfo')}>Learn more</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="callout">
<div class="callout-in c-center">
<p class="callout-k">Did you know?</p>
<p class="callout-t" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Most month-end pain starts before anyone opens the books.</p>
<p class="callout-p" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">Receipts, timesheets and unsent invoices decide how hard the close is, weeks before anyone looks at the ledger.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="seg seg-white">
<div class="seg-in c-center">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Why owners hire us</p>
<h2 class="h2">Someone who answers three questions before you ask them.</h2>
<figure class="figure figure-side why-panel">
<Image class="shot-img" src={kevinDesk} alt="Kevin Loo smiling at a table with a laptop and a mug of coffee" widths={[480, 720, 1048]} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 524px" />
<div>
<h3 class="h3" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-5)">Someone who runs a business too.</h3>
<p class="p" style="margin-bottom:0">Kevin runs Parallel himself, so he knows what it is like to be the one signing the cheques. That is most of why the first call goes the way it does. He asks what your month looks like now, not what your systems are.</p>
</div>
</figure>
<div class="pts">
<div class="pt"><span class="pt-n">01</span><p>He runs a business himself, so cash flow and payroll do not need explaining twice.</p></div>
<div class="pt"><span class="pt-n">02</span><p>A scope and a price in writing before anything moves, so no invoice surprises you later.</p></div>
<div class="pt"><span class="pt-n">03</span><p>One point of contact throughout, not a rotating junior handed your file.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>

<section class="seg on-tan">
<div class="seg-in c-center">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>How it works</p>
<h2 class="h2">Four steps, then it stays off your plate.</h2>
<ol class="steps" style="margin-bottom:0">
<li class="step"><span class="pt-n">01</span><p>A call. Twenty minutes, and you do most of the talking.</p></li>
<li class="step"><span class="pt-n">02</span><p>We look at what you have now, in whatever state it is in.</p></li>
<li class="step"><span class="pt-n">03</span><p>A scope and a price, in writing, before anything moves.</p></li>
<li class="step"><span class="pt-n">04</span><p>Handover, once. Then it stays off your plate.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section class="seg">
<div class="seg-in split" style="align-items:center">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Where we work</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:var(--space-5)">Anywhere in British Columbia, delivered remotely.</h2>
<p class="p" style="margin-bottom:0">Island grown and raised, and working with businesses from Victoria to the Lower Mainland, the Interior and the North.</p>
</div>
<div class="area-box">
<ul class="list-u">
<li>Meetings by phone or video, whichever is easier for you.</li>
<li>Documents move online, so nothing has to be dropped off in person.</li>
<li>Victoria, Vancouver or Prince George, the process does not change.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="seg on-tan">
<div class="seg-in c-center">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>What our clients are saying</p>
<blockquote class="quote big-quote">
<p class="quote-t ph">They had the bookkeeping off my plate inside a week, and I have not thought about it since.</p>
<cite class="quote-w ph">First name L.<span class="quote-r">Owner, a small business, Victoria BC</span></cite>
</blockquote>
</div>
</section>

<section class="seg">
<div class="seg-in split">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Common questions</p>
<h2 class="h2">What owners ask before the first call.</h2>
</div>
<ul class="faq">
<li class="faq-i">
<button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="true">What happens when I call?<span class="faq-s" aria-hidden="true">&ndash;</span></button>
<p class="faq-a">You talk to Kevin. He asks what the books look like now and what is eating your week. That is the whole first call.</p>
</li>
<li class="faq-i">
<button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What do I need to have ready?<span class="faq-s" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<p class="faq-a faq-shut">Nothing. If you have last year's file and access to the bank feed, we can move faster.</p>
</li>
<li class="faq-i">
<button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">Do you work with businesses outside Victoria?<span class="faq-s" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<p class="faq-a faq-shut">Yes. Parallel works with businesses across British Columbia. The work is delivered remotely, so where you are does not change how it runs.</p>
</li>
<li class="faq-i">
<button class="faq-q" type="button" aria-expanded="false">What does this cost?<span class="faq-s" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
<p class="faq-a faq-shut">It depends on what is on your plate. You get a scope and a price in writing on the first call, before anything moves.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section class="seg on-tan">
<div class="seg-in c-center">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Find us</p>
<h2 class="h2">Based in Victoria, working across BC.</h2>
<div class="ct-grid">
<div class="ct-card">
<div class="nap-body">
<a class="tel-lg nap-tel" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>
<ul class="rows">
<li class="row"><span class="row-k">Email</span><span class="row-v"><a href={site.mailto}>{site.email}</a></span></li>
<li class="row"><span class="row-k">Address</span><span class="row-v">{site.address}</span></li>
<li class="row"><span class="row-k">Hours</span><span class="row-v ph">{site.hours}</span></li>
<li class="row"><span class="row-k">Area</span><span class="row-v">All of British Columbia, delivered remotely.</span></li>
</ul>
<p class="btn-row" style="margin-top:var(--space-6)"><a class="btn-txt" href={site.directions} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="nap-map ct-map has-map"><iframe src={site.mapEmbed} title="Map showing the Parallel Accounting office" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<div class="cta on-dark cta-c">
<div class="cta-in">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="mark"></span>Next step</p>
<h2 class="h2 cta-h">You do not need to know what to ask for.</h2>
<p class="cta-p">Tell Kevin what the month looks like now and he will tell you which part of it we would take.</p>
</div>
<div class="cta-act">
<a class="tel" href={site.tel}>{site.phone}</a>
<a class="btn btn-1" href={u('/contact/')}>Book a call</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
